{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16080","headline":"江陵即事 · 王建","name":"江陵即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瘴云梅雨不成泥，十里津楼压大堤。\n蜀女下沙迎水客，巴童傍驿卖山鸡。\n寺多红药烧人眼，地足青苔染马蹄。\n夜半独眠愁在远，北看归路隔蛮溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}